            <p class="demo-muted" style="font-size: 0.875rem; margin: 0;">Verifier fetches the issuer's public key, validates signature, consults CRL, returns verdict.</p>
            <details style="margin-top: 0.875rem;">
              <summary>Show response</summary>
              <pre>{`{
  "verified": true,
  "verdict": "allow",
  "passport": { "issuer": "demo.agentpki.dev", … },
  "crl_fresh": true,
  "abuse_score": 0.02,
  "elapsed_ms": 21
}`}</pre>
